":"벡터 단원을 시작할 때, 기브스가 학생들을 위해 쓴 강의 노트에서 벡터 해석이 다듬어졌다는 이야기를 들려주세요.","art":"coordinates","event":"1826년 오늘, 종교와 상관없이 학생을 받는 유니버시티 칼리지 런던이 세워졌어요.","born":[{"year":"1657","name":"Bernard de Fontenelle","slug":"Fontenelle"},{"year":"1800","name":"Henry Fox Talbot","slug":"Talbot"},{"year":"1839","name":"J Willard Gibbs","slug":"Gibbs"},{"year":"1854","name":"Benjamin Osgood Peirce","slug":"Peirce_B_O"},{"year":"1862","name":"Francis Macaulay","slug":"Macaulay"},{"year":"1865","name":"Anders Wiman","slug":"Wiman"},{"year":"1887","name":"John Jackson","slug":"Jackson"},{"year":"1897","name":"Emil Post","slug":"Post"},{"year":"1909","name":"Friedrich Bachmann","slug":"Bachmann_Friedrich"},{"year":"1909","name":"Claude Chevalley","slug":"Chevalley"},{"year":"1915","name":"Richard Hamming","slug":"Hamming"},{"year":"1917","name":"Andrzej Alexiewicz","slug":"Alexiewicz"},{"year":"1920","name":"Ernst Specker","slug":"Specker"},{"year":"1920","name":"Ernst Selmer","slug":"Selmer"},{"year":"1921","name":"Yozo Matsushima","slug":"Matsushima"},{"year":"1927","name":"Dimitrei D Stancu","slug":"Stancu"}],"died":[{"year":"1617","name":"Giovanni Magini","slug":"Magini"},{"year":"1626","name":"Pietro Cataldi","slug":"Cataldi"},{"year":"1650","name":"René Descartes","slug":"Descartes"},{"year":"1868","name":"Léon Foucault","slug":"Foucault"},{"year":"1923","name":"Wilhelm Killing","slug":"Killing"},{"year":"1942","name":"Egbert van Kampen","slug":"Van_Kampen"},{"year":"1947","name":"Nicolae Abramescu","slug":"Abramescu"},{"year":"1974","name":"Vladimir Smirnov","slug":"Smirnov"},{"year":"1976","name":"Dorothy Wrinch","slug":"Wrinch"},{"year":"2008","name":"Alexander Andreevich Samarskii","slug":"Samarskii"},{"year":"2016","name":"Hans Meinhardt","slug":"Meinhardt"},{"year":"2021","name":"Isadore Singer","slug":"Singer"},{"year":"2025","name":"Yvonne Bruhat","slug":"Choquet-Bruhat"}]},{"date":"02-12","slug":"Neumann_Hanna","kind":"born","year":"1914","life":"1914–1971","name":"Hanna Neuma